<title>USA: SunGard Data sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>SunGard Data sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>SunGard Data Systems Inc said Friday its board authorized a two-for-one stock split on all shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The split will be effective for shareholders of record on September 2.</p>
<p>For every one share of the company's common stock held on the record date, the holder will receive one additional share. Certificates for the additional shares will be issued on September 22.</p>
</text>
